                        "glosses": [
                            "The fact or condition of having more than two mammae or nipples."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1071cbb6-ac41-4d9f-8ee7-0cde4194ba53",
                                "sense_id": "d16cfd2b-0296-3dfd-8cc7-392d2fb95082",
                                "text": "Viewed in the light of comparative anatomy, polymastia is interesting, as showing a tendency to re-establish the series of mammae seen in other mammalia; but Darwin has lately repudiated atavism as a cause of this malformation"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ba54ed1-bde3-4156-8eed-fb56b53a2822",
                                "sense_id": "d16cfd2b-0296-3dfd-8cc7-392d2fb95082",
                                "text": "The warts on its skin, you see, remind one of the extra nipples which every she-witch was supposed to have and that goes back (am I boring you, dear boy? How is your glass?) that goes back to the polymastia or superfluity of breasts of the ancients."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
